to put such decorative bases on my wood carvings. That said, due to sizing issues, we can only put one ornament on one wood carving...","nextNodeIds":[220440110]},{"nodeId":220440110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":3102184426,"text":"But I'm thinking that if the decorations are detachable, I can just put on whatever decorations my customers request.","nextNodeIds":[220440111]},{"nodeId":220440111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":3534360210,"text":"I'd probably want to start from simpler decorations... Something like Naku Weed.","nextNodeIds":[220440112]},{"nodeId":220440112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":2979907250,"text":"So, Traveler, could you help me gather 3 stalks of Naku Weed back to use for reference?","nextNodeIds":[220440113,220440114]},{"nodeId":220440113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":945632458,"text":"I've got your back.","nextNodeIds":[220440117]},{"nodeId":220440117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":3288647314,"text":"Sorry, Traveler, but I'll be leaving this in your hands. Come back and look for me once you have those Naku Weeds.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":220440114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":596853802,"text":"Why three?","nextNodeIds":[220440115]},{"nodeId":220440115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":1988113082,"text":"If I can get three, I can view them in three different states.","nextNodeIds":[220440116]},{"nodeId":220440116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":971755674,"text":"That way, I should be able to carve the best Naku Weed that I can.","nextNodeIds":[220440117]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"B